WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.510
Do the data leave the practice?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.370
No.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:09.870
No identifiable record
leaves the practice.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.970
Every use of the data is governed
by a digital contract

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.450
that defines who accesses, for
what and for how long.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.090
And that contract does not stay on paper:
the machine enforces it itself.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.610
If a request has no contract,
there is no access.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.710
If it has one, only an aggregated
result comes back.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.090
The practice always decides, within
the framework of the

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:38.270
General Data Protection Regulation and
national law in each country,

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.610
under the supervision of its data
protection authority.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.370
And with a clear rule of the
European Health Data Space:

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.920
health data are never used
for advertising.
